  "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\">This folder contains the materials for my analyses of a publicly available video from The Daily Moth, including a link to the original video, the clip that I selected, and the .eaf file containing my annotations. To access the annotation file, please use ELAN, available for free download here: https://archive.mpi.nl/tla/elan/download </p><p dir=\"ltr\">My calculations are available here in three formats: </p><ul><li>PDF</li><li>.csv files - one file for each sheet</li><li>Link to a view-only version of my Google Sheets file</li></ul><p></p>",
